<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 17.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 17.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.53    5.15</p>
<p> 2   BT Prop Trust	  11.20    1.77</p>
<p> 3   Mt Leyshon Gold	10.96    2.28</p>
<p> 4   Prime Credit Tr	 9.61    1.02</p>
<p> 5   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
<p> 6   Westpac Prop Tr	 9.44    1.71</p>
<p> 7   Villa World	     9.32    1.18</p>
<p> 8   Prop Income Inv	 9.16    1.10</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	   8.96    0.96</p>
